OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey to shield low-income pensioners
OL,4,Afrom income tax in the Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government had already committed to
OL,7,Fnot taxing people who only get an
OL,8,Fincome from the state pension. Healey
OL,9,Fwill explain this pledge will be met by
OL,10,Fplans for a new tax allowance for
OL,11,Flow-income pensioners.
OL,13,FHealey's plans come as the
OL,14,FConservatives and Reform UK unveil
OL,15,Ftheir alternative Budget proposals,
OL,16,Fincluding deep cuts to the welfare
OL,17,Fbill.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
