OL,3,AAnthropic warns of 'catastrophic risk'
OL,4,Ato humankind ahead of blockbuster share
OL,5,Alisting
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic has warned artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence could pose "catastrophic
OL,9,For existential risks to humanity" as it
OL,10,Funveiled details of its planned
OL,11,Fblockbuster stock market listing in the
OL,12,FUS.
OL,14,FThe company behind AI chatbot Claude
OL,15,Frevealed losses of more than $80.7bn
OL,16,F(#60.5bn) in the first half of the
OL,17,Fyear, but said it had $112.4bn in cash
OL,18,For equivalents, and generated revenues
OL,19,Fof $16.3bn over the same period.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
